# No live curriculum AI

- Do not implement runtime generation of quests, tests, patterns, hints, or story briefs for players.
- Educational content is authored into committed files under `content/` (and documented in `docs/`).
- AI mentoring (BYO key) is a later phase; it must not decide unlocks, invent tests, or replace Judge0.
- Optional offline AI may only fill approved story dialogue slots, then requires human review before merge — see `docs/CONTENT.md` (AI boundaries).
- If asked to “just have the model make problems,” refuse that approach and point to `docs/CONTENT.md`.
